==Battleground==
*1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 8~12 seconds<sup>240f~360f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Bore]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Bore]] spawns after 113.33 seconds<sup>3,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Because of the fact that only red enemies are present in this stage, [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] paired with [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]] makes this stage a breeze.

